# horcruxes

Voldemort concealed his splitted soul inside 7 horcruxes. Find all horcruxes, and ROP it!

## Remote

Direct connection: `nc pwnable.kr 10016`

connect to port 10016 (nc pwnable.kr 10016). the 'horcruxes' binary will be executed under horcruxes_pwn privilege.
rop it to read the flag.

## Local run

Run `./run.sh`, then connect with `nc 127.0.0.1 10016`.
